    "content": "# 0.15.0

Released 2026-09-24

## Breaking changes

- \`topics\` in \`harness.yaml\` are now declared per project. (#128)

## Bug fixes

- Saving feedback no longer fails offline. (#131)

## Upgrade guide

### \`topics\` in \`harness.yaml\` are now declared per project.

Move \`topics.<name>\` to \`projects.<name>.topic\`.
