exports[`apply > renders the default-zh template > v0.15.0.zh.md 1`] = `
"# 0.15.0

发布日期：2026-09-24

## 不兼容变更

- \`topics\` in \`harness.yaml\` are now declared per project.（#128）

## 修复

- Saving feedback no longer fails offline.（#131）

## 升级指南

### \`topics\` in \`harness.yaml\` are now declared per project.

Move \`topics.<name>\` to \`projects.<name>.topic\`.
"
`;

exports[`apply > writes version and notes, deletes fragments, and is safe to re-run > v0.15.0.md 1`] = `
"# 0.15.0

Released 2026-09-24

## Breaking changes

- \`topics\` in \`harness.yaml\` are now declared per project. (#128)

## Bug fixes

- Saving feedback no longer fails offline. (#131)

## Upgrade guide

### \`topics\` in \`harness.yaml\` are now declared per project.

Move \`topics.<name>\` to \`projects.<name>.topic\`.
"
`;

